{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226580","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226580","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1422658001:0":{"text":"오랜만입니다, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 치피와 해미도 오랜만이야.","source_cn":"久违了，<style=stress><player_n...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4941482668D8E843","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"오랜만입니다, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 치피와 해미도 오랜만이야.","female":"오랜만입니다, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 치피와 해미도 오랜만이야.","variant_male_record_index":"166937","variant_female_record_index":"166938","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422658002:1":{"text":"그동안 수고했어, 브라이언.","source_cn":"这段时间辛苦你了，布莱恩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EF1395B8C58F62C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422658003:0":{"text":"이분이 바로 셀로클랜드에서 오신 인듀어 씨입니까? 전 에이론이라고 합니다.","source_cn":"这位就是来自萨洛克兰的因度厄先生吗？我是埃隆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B55714DDCC04DAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422658004:0":{"text":"인듀어라고 부르셔도 됩니다, 에이론. 절 위해 여기까지 와주셔서 감사합니다.","source_cn":"请直接称呼我为因度厄吧，埃隆。感谢你专程归来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B02D2FBDE8EBCAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422658005:1":{"text":"네. 아든 선생님께 오신 이유는 들었습니다. 상황이 급하니 바로 본론으로 들어가지요.","source_cn":"嗯。雅顿老师已向我